  "vision_en": "To remain the spiritual home of the Hindu community in Sabah — a temple where the devotion first kindled by the Hindu soldiers of Lok Kawi in 1970 continues to grow, and where every generation that follows finds a place to worship Lord Murugan, celebrate their traditions, and belong.",
