  "mission_en": "To conduct daily poojas and abhishekams with sincerity and discipline; to keep Hindu festivals, Tamil language, and culture alive for younger devotees; to welcome all who seek blessings, community, or a meal at our Annadhanam table; and to sustain and grow this temple through the same spirit of gotong-royong that built it.",
